The naxp package as a whole is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE.md).

It includes the naxp C++ library, version 0.15.0, as the three amalgamated files
from the tagged release at https://github.com/naxp-org/naxp, with their contents
unchanged:

  src/naxp.cpp     released as naxp.cpp
  src/naxp.h       released as naxp.h
  src/naxp_cpp.h   released as naxp.hpp

naxp.hpp is renamed because R CMD check accepts only .h headers at the top of
src/. Nothing includes it by name, and it still matches the naxp.hpp line in the
release's SHA256SUMS.

The tests also include the naxp conformance data, tests/testthat/naxp-v0.10.json,
taken unchanged from conformance/naxp-v0.10.json in the same tagged release.

That library and its conformance data are also distributed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0:

  Copyright 2026 Tim Gordon
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
